{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "0149a85e-1873-5267-84af-8709f99c27aa" :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)=-\frac{(x-3)^2}{\sqrt{x}}$. Expand the numerator and divide each term by $x^{1/2}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
f(x)&=\frac{-x^{2}+6x-9}{x^{1/2}}\\
&=-x^{\frac{3}{2}}+6x^{\frac{1}{2}}-9x^{-\frac{1}{2}}
\end{aligned}
$$

Apply the power rule:

$$
f'(x)=-\frac{3}{2}x^{\frac{1}{2}}+3x^{-\frac{1}{2}}+\frac{9}{2}x^{-\frac{3}{2}}
$$

The tangent slope at $\left(4,-\frac{1}{2}\right)$ is

$$
\begin{aligned}
m=f'(4)&=-\frac{3}{2}\left(4\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}+3\left(4\right)^{-\frac{1}{2}}+\frac{9}{2}\left(4\right)^{-\frac{3}{2}}\\
&=-3+\frac{3}{2}+\frac{9}{16}\\
&=-\frac{15}{16}
\end{aligned}
$$

The normal is perpendicular to the tangent, so take the negative reciprocal:

$$
\begin{aligned}
m'&=-\frac{1}{m}\\
&=-\frac{1}{\left(-\frac{15}{16}\right)}\\
&=\frac{16}{15}
\end{aligned}
$$"] [:db/add "0149a85e-1873-5267-84af-8709f99c27aa" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "0149a85e-1873-5267-84af-8709f99c27aa" :question/answer-fields "2267e857-aa87-5e82-ac21-3bfa172671c7"] [:db/ensure "0149a85e-1873-5267-84af-8709f99c27aa" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092384 :knowledge-point/questions "0149a85e-1873-5267-84af-8709f99c27aa"] [:db/add "01827d3b-3746-5887-8b76-d50e0b44f355" :answer/id #uuid "01827d3b-3746-5887-8b76-d50e0b44f355"] [:db/add "01827d3b-3746-5887-8b76-d50e0b44f355" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "01827d3b-3746-5887-8b76-d50e0b44f355" :answer/value "\frac{27}{130}"] [:db/ensure "01827d3b-3746-5887-8b76-d50e0b44f355" :answer/validate] [:db/add "692a0d7e-4c67-54cf-aa69-84cd36afb8e8" :answer-field/id #uuid "692a0d7e-4c67-54cf-aa69-84cd36afb8e8"] [:db/add "692a0d7e-4c67-54cf-aa69-84cd36afb8e8" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "692a0d7e-4c67-54cf-aa69-84cd36afb8e8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "692a0d7e-4c67-54cf-aa69-84cd36afb8e8" :answer-field/choices "01827d3b-3746-5887-8b76-d50e0b44f355"] [:db/add "692a0d7e-4c67-54cf-aa69-84cd36afb8e8" :answer-field/correct "01827d3b-3746-5887-8b76-d50e0b44f355"] [:db/ensure "692a0d7e-4c67-54cf-aa69-84cd36afb8e8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e664df6f-8587-5fd1-a057-f264471f4275" :question/id #uuid "e664df6f-8587-5fd1-a057-f264471f4275"] [:db/add "e664df6f-8587-5fd1-a057-f264471f4275" :question/problem "Find the slope $m'$ of the normal line to the curve

