{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "e664df6f-8587-5fd1-a057-f264471f4275" :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)=-\frac{(x+1)^2}{\sqrt{x}}$. Expand the numerator and divide each term by $x^{1/2}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
f(x)&=\frac{-x^{2}-2x-1}{x^{1/2}}\\
&=-x^{\frac{3}{2}}-2x^{\frac{1}{2}}-x^{-\frac{1}{2}}
\end{aligned}
$$

Apply the power rule:

$$
f'(x)=-\frac{3}{2}x^{\frac{1}{2}}-x^{-\frac{1}{2}}+\frac{1}{2}x^{-\frac{3}{2}}
$$

The tangent slope at $\left(9,-\frac{100}{3}\right)$ is

$$
\begin{aligned}
m=f'(9)&=-\frac{3}{2}\left(9\right)^{\frac{1}{2}}-\left(9\right)^{-\frac{1}{2}}+\frac{1}{2}\left(9\right)^{-\frac{3}{2}}\\
&=-\frac{9}{2}-\frac{1}{3}+\frac{1}{54}\\
&=-\frac{130}{27}
\end{aligned}
$$

The normal is perpendicular to the tangent, so take the negative reciprocal:

$$
\begin{aligned}
m'&=-\frac{1}{m}\\
&=-\frac{1}{\left(-\frac{130}{27}\right)}\\
&=\frac{27}{130}
\end{aligned}
$$"] [:db/add "e664df6f-8587-5fd1-a057-f264471f4275" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e664df6f-8587-5fd1-a057-f264471f4275" :question/answer-fields "692a0d7e-4c67-54cf-aa69-84cd36afb8e8"] [:db/ensure "e664df6f-8587-5fd1-a057-f264471f4275" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092384 :knowledge-point/questions "e664df6f-8587-5fd1-a057-f264471f4275"] [:db/add "1471244c-d8d6-591a-a70d-46c73ac414fe" :answer/id #uuid "1471244c-d8d6-591a-a70d-46c73ac414fe"] [:db/add "1471244c-d8d6-591a-a70d-46c73ac414fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1471244c-d8d6-591a-a70d-46c73ac414fe" :answer/value "-\frac{2}{3}"] [:db/ensure "1471244c-d8d6-591a-a70d-46c73ac414fe" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6d31e2a3-d838-5cbf-a0e3-5001a3f62c6c" :answer-field/id #uuid "6d31e2a3-d838-5cbf-a0e3-5001a3f62c6c"] [:db/add "6d31e2a3-d838-5cbf-a0e3-5001a3f62c6c" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "6d31e2a3-d838-5cbf-a0e3-5001a3f62c6c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "6d31e2a3-d838-5cbf-a0e3-5001a3f62c6c" :answer-field/choices "1471244c-d8d6-591a-a70d-46c73ac414fe"] [:db/add "6d31e2a3-d838-5cbf-a0e3-5001a3f62c6c" :answer-field/correct "1471244c-d8d6-591a-a70d-46c73ac414fe"] [:db/ensure "6d31e2a3-d838-5cbf-a0e3-5001a3f62c6c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7e7d3211-8724-59e8-8faa-fdbf1204fed9" :question/id #uuid "7e7d3211-8724-59e8-8faa-fdbf1204fed9"] [:db/add "7e7d3211-8724-59e8-8faa-fdbf1204fed9" :question/problem "Find the slope $m'$ of the normal line to the curve

